<title>UK: Gulf Canada says Clyde offer full value.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada says Clyde offer full value.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources said on Tuesday that its raised offer for Clyde Petroleum Plc represented 100 percent of the &quot;inflated value&quot; put on the company by Clyde's own consultants.</p>
<p>In a statement Gulf Canada said that in other contested offers in the sector, prices accepted by shareholders were &quot;on average 75 percent of the consultants' net asset valuations.&quot;</p>
<p>Gulf Canada said that by Monday afternoon it had received valid acceptances of its earlier 105 pence per share offer from shareholders representing 0.17 percent of Clyde's issued ordinary share capital.</p>
</text>
